<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71407" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νωτ-ίζω</span></b> , only in aor. exc. in compd.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turn one's back,</i>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ δὲ . . πρὸς φυγὴν ἐνώτισαν</span>”
				<i>turned their backs and fled,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					1141
				</span></i>
			 : c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλίσσυτον δράμημα νωτίσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					193
				</span></i>
			 : abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νωτίσας θυέτω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IPE</u>
					2.342
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Phanagoria</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cover the back of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρέφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					654
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>skim the surface of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόντον νωτίσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					286
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νωτίσασθαι</span>”
				<i>carry on the back,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
